  <item>
    <title>我们的脑子就是被这些古早言情剧看坏的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67126854db2cf827573b9519</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67126854db2cf827573b9519</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Oct 2024 13:53:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【节目梗概📍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“回忆过去痛苦的相思忘不了～”和千禧年出生的两位主播一起回忆那些年看过的言情剧：《一起来看流星雨》，《刁蛮公主》等。从琼瑶剧到台偶再到韩剧，里面男女主人公的情感纠葛影响了一众90到00代的人的恋爱观。当恋爱观塑成后在看当代台剧和韩剧又是截然不同的风格，更加现实主义。再看内娱！甚至不如童年。于是乎呐喊：“我们的脑子就是被这些古早言情剧看坏的！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴📍】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>流星雨又来临、那些年cos过的七仙女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a>情深深雨蒙蒙360℃包围式吻戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>细数琼瑶剧的震撼爱情观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>台偶启蒙《流星花园》，校园灰姑娘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>什么！湘琴尽然接近智力障碍，细数偶像剧中的男女异位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a>小时候看偶像剧很甜、当下看现实……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a>欧巴来席，各种罗曼史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a>恋爱脑长出来了，被渣男创。警惕造梦陷阱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a>经典韩剧三件套</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a>韩剧转型，专注复仇、现实生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a>台剧转型聚焦社会议题，直面主角的不完美</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgIbxU0ZZwNyJPKB5NWTZnZIkK0F.m4a" length="43012843" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDXjjeX8b7jOg9H52az3mqduT7f.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从《我家那闺女》看东亚女出走的这一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a877bd33ddcbb53c0df599</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a877bd33ddcbb53c0df599</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 05:18:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【节目梗概📍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我家那闺女》不仅仅是一档让人轻松解压的下饭综艺，也是中式家庭的一个微缩景观。两个主播在捧腹大笑的同时，也透过节目嘉宾各不相同的家庭模式来对中式亲子关系激情开麦。都说“乡愁是属于男性的奥德赛,而逃离是属于女性的史诗”、“孝顺是一种过时的观念”。让我们一起通过这些激烈而绝望的呼声，一同理一理这混沌又纠葛的古老课题吧。由我们来说出你压抑太久的话，不再讳莫如深，不再无人理解，不再集体失语。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考图片📍】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrhYP72rKSh5r5el2eqwPWtoDM53.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNNy22HII_vtRd9LFvkeZ6t1gSk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>李湘母女</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2IOCCVTDADSaTfsz9vhlBOXorQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulneBqNWQe5HdgNNIiHVkqhPICY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>谷爱凌母女</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZGTvbw3ySBCEtZZzB5g8A6YE0q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgD69SGrW7TQU2B0Ydddo-ohkupz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>伊能静母子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴📍】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 人人都羡慕的“江浙沪独生女”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 打压式教育的血和泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 优秀而崩溃的女性都是怎么被培养出来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 爱的教育的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 父母也是个高标准岗位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 生育=当官？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 离异是外部催化的苦情剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2021">33:41</a> 孝顺是一种过时的观念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 警惕奴仆式教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2821">47:01</a> 男女的两个剧本</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls2kL8zye7q5hSs1rVrK4o4yWACf.m4a" length="44927638" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDXjjeX8b7jOg9H52az3mqduT7f.jpg"/>
