  </item>
  <item>
    <title>细数我跟房东干的那些仗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669756e28fcadceb90e61784</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669756e28fcadceb90e61784</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2024 05:30:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【节目梗概📍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;正值如火如荼的大学生毕业季，两位主播针对同学们从学生到社会人这个身份转变的不适应这一点，结合自身经历给刚开始远离家乡工作的同学们提供一点点租房建议。奇遇经历从“诈骗中介”到“鬼屋历险”，看房类型也从“公寓房”、“商品房”到“回迁房”。已知短短半年已经辗转三个房子，跟各类房东大战三百回合。用我们各种啼笑皆非的踩雷故事来帮助听众见证厉害关系，提前规避风险。愿大家在异地工作生活中都能遇到一套称心如意的房子，完美开启人生新篇章。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴📍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在杭州租房的那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 刚到杭州，就遇上“诈骗中介”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 勇闯“鬼宅”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 超灵活智能空调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 租房小TIPS</span></p><span></span><p><span>家乡与生活地的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> 家乡的倦怠感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 不同的城市有不同的磁场和性格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 小城市生活成本竟高过大城市？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 逃离家乡也是逃离原生家庭</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo0V6jPFLnYlAtMCapZtqZVboStY.m4a" length="22864880" type="audio/mp4"/>
